        "    # credentials file matches them. Scoped to the one test function GuardDog",
        "    # reports the hit in, so a real finding elsewhere in the file is still reported",
        "    # and the entry keeps covering the write when edits move the lines. The test",
        "    # file writes creds.env twice, in two test functions; GuardDog 3.2.0 drops a",
        "    # match whose code snippet is the same as one it already reported, so it",
        "    # reports only the first, whose enclosing function this entry names.",
